長を務めている。真凜とは親友の間柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々お堅い性格で、女だけの里に男がやって来ることにも反対だった。一生清い身体でいます。なんて言って、憚らなかったのだが…。実はオナニー大好きな女の子。そのことで密かに悩んでもいた。性格は実際お堅いけれど、体つきはやっぱりものすごい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事情がきっかけとなって、主人公とのエッチなレッスンに参加することになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"103943"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb219cbf012eb392adbcc4de674c1d7c0d1587939b24e3aa7a931c573c13cff3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0c949fbde086b1485a8999d6a8af5e2eb21ef5a583abd9cf9f2ca1d3f028d08.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高村優里","creatorId":"vndb:s354","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s354","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s354","name":"高村 優里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:363314:103943:13512:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c107512","characterName":"忍野 路加","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"103946","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"363315"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24414"],"vndbCharacterId":"c107512"},"originalCharacterName":"忍野 路加","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A succubus who works as a caretaker of the school dormitory, Ruka was Kouichi's classmate when they were in high school and also his first love. Due to some circumstances, on the day when they were supposed to go on their first date, they were forced to be apart and had lost contact with each other since then. They reunited when Kouichi was brought to the village by Mami and Marin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At the end of the second title, Ruka admits to Kouichi that she is still somewhat has f